  "water_pixel": "seasons/s2_MM.tif: NDWI (NIR from red and NDVI) > 0 or NIR < 0.04, not bright (water_seasons.py)",
  "water": "per 20 m pixel max(frequency, fraction): frequency = wet months / observed (>= 3); fraction = its NDWI's 75th percentile over the clear months unmixed between the never-wet land within 300 m and the tile's always-wet water (median NDWI; 0.3 with under 10 such pixels); DEM slope < 0.2, DEM > 0.5 m; bilinear onto the 5 m grid, water at >= 0.5",
